  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Certain words have no collision for the player to stand on upon respawning, thus leading to the player getting into a loop of falling and respawning. As the player gains speed while falling, the menu that would be used to change worlds or go to the player's home world can be made impossible due to the falling speed giving no time for the menu to be open. A simple fix to this would simply making the menu not close upon respawning, making the player able to simply change worlds and thus not have to restart their game.",
